your card, about $3 to\n$4 per mailbox a month. Your main domain never sends cold email, so it can never get burned.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Lookalike sending domains and their mailboxes are provisioned together through a mailbox provider, on your account and your card, about $3 to\n$4 per mailbox a month. Your main domain never sends cold email, so it can never get burned.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_33", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2042, "y": -90, "width": 1048, "height": 326, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_34", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -74, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - AUTHENTICATION THAT KEEPS YOU OUT OF SPAM", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - AUTHENTICATION THAT KEEPS YOU OUT OF SPAM", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": -38, "width": 1004, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "fra